{"id":"09791de618b277ba","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-induction-schema.md","title":"按语言参数化的完全归纳模式","display":"df-induction-schema — 按语言参数化的完全归纳模式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-induction-schema","aliases":["91-df-induction-schema","91-df-induction-axiom","91-df-mathematical-induction"],"display":"df-induction-schema — 按语言参数化的完全归纳模式","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-language-with-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-induction-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-induction-schema</span><span>91-df-induction-axiom</span><span>91-df-mathematical-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-induction-schema — 按语言参数化的完全归纳模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 含算术语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是公式集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y\">\\(\\vec y\\)</span> 是与归纳变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 不同的全部参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为基础算术；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典一阶演绎闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Ind}_0,\\mathrm{Ind}_T,\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Ind}_0,\\mathrm{Ind}_T,\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span> 是下述模式和理论的记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall\\vec y\\,\\bigl[(\\varphi(0,\\vec y)\\land\n\\forall x(\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\to\\varphi(Sx,\\vec y)))\\to\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\bigr]:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L},\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,\\vec y\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall\\vec y\\,\\bigl[(\\varphi(0,\\vec y)\\land\n\\forall x(\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\to\\varphi(Sx,\\vec y)))\\to\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\bigr]:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L},\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,\\vec y\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 TB、UTB、CT、FS、KF 均含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span>。限制为基础语言归纳的版本由原书下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\upharpoonright\\)</span> 区分；本目录 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 对应原书 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\upharpoonright\\)</span>。\nTB 和 UTB 即使含完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\)</span> 也对 PA 保守（Theorem 7.5）。所以“加入真理归纳”本身不推出非保守性，必须结合真理公理判断。\n这里是元理论按标准公式枚举的模式；不把所有非标准公式编码的归纳公理一次对象量化。内部归纳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\text{归纳公理}\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\text{归纳公理}\\urcorner)\\)</span> 也须与上述外部模式区分。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1，印刷页 30–31，PDF 页 41–42；Definitions 7.1–7.3、Theorem 7.5，印刷页 53–55，PDF 页 64–66。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec y","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Ind}_0,\\mathrm{Ind}_T,\\mathrm{PA}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall\\vec y\\,\\bigl[(\\varphi(0,\\vec y)\\land\n\\forall x(\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\to\\varphi(Sx,\\vec y)))\\to\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\bigr]:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L},\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,\\vec y\\}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\upharpoonright","display":false},{"tex":"^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\upharpoonright","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\text{归纳公理}\\urcorner)","display":false}],"bytes":2080,"backlinks":[{"id":"d039c2f88345c0e7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ 为基础语言六条编码组合公理加 PA；$\\mathrm{Ind}_T$、$\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}$ 见 [[91-df-induction-schema]]。"},{"id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}_T\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T})$，见 [[91-df-induction-schema]]。"},{"id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}_T$ 包含全 $\\mathcal L_T$ 归纳，见 [[91-df-induction-schema]]。"},{"id":"99cc98508e51c9ee","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a804bf41cb20efd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}$ 为基础算术；$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}$ 为 [[91-df-induction-schema]] 的全语言归纳模式。"},{"id":"706acac2c3076a7b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5e2485d60abdf08e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathr